:: OC Mata The New Kid At School 3 [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you both continue eating, you begin to chat and ask him how his day is going. He seems a little awkward to be eating and talking at the same time but also seems to enjoy your company. He explains that his day has been pretty good, though a little confusing. Lots of words he has yet to learn and he gets some strange looks from people whenever he talks. You try to calm his nerves, explaining that some people just aren’t used to anything different. Things will calm down once they get used to him. <br>
<br>
Just as you are settling into another conversation, you hear it: <span style="color:LightCoral">snickering from a nearby table.</span> You both glance in the direction at the same time. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Check out the new kid.”</span> A boy at the tables whispers just loud enough for you both to be able to hear him with ease. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Still eating like he’s at some samurai sushi diner or something. I mean, he’s using like sticks to eat?”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">The kids laugh and snicker under their breath.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? Do they not have forks over there?”</span> Another adds in, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I thought they were supposed to be ‘advanced’!”</span> They all laugh again. You feel anger welling up inside you. Stupid kids make fun of anything they don’t understand. It just makes them look even more stupid. You move to tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mata</span> to ignore them, <span style="color:LightCoral">but then notice that his face is flushing a deep, painful red as he has frozen mid-movement, the sausage slipping form his chopsticks.</span>

